Package: mkconnect
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: comm
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Recommends: libssl3t64 | libssl3, openssh-client
Homepage: https://github.com/mythicalkingdom/mkbbs
Description: terminal program for BBSs with a dialing directory
 mkconnect calls bulletin board systems over Telnet, Telnet in TLS, raw TCP
 or ssh, in the way of QModem: a dialing directory sealed with a start
 password, the screens of the system as they were drawn (CP437 turned into
 UTF-8, colours kept), Zmodem, Ymodem and Xmodem transfers both ways with
 automatic Zmodem start, login scripts, multi-dial and a call log.
 .
 It is part of the MK BBS (package mkbbs, which includes it); it needs no
 BBS to run.
